.TH AD_LAYER_INDENT_LAST 1 "2026-08-30" "ad 2.0" "ad layers"
.SH NAME
ad_layer_indent_last \- move leading whitespace deletes to end of line segment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ad_layer_indent_last
< post_ops > indent_last_ops
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ad_layer_indent_last
reorders ops so that when a line is entirely deleted, the leading whitespace (spaces/tabs) deletes appear AFTER the content deletes. This prevents the visual problem of text shifting left before disappearing.
.PP
Algorithm:
.RS
.IP 1. 3
Walk ops, breaking into segments at \\n ops or line number changes.
.IP 2. 3
For each segment, find the leading run of indent deletes (space/tab).
.IP 3. 3
If indent deletes exist, emit: content ops (with col += n_indent), then indent deletes (at col 1), then the \\n op.
.RE
.PP
The col adjustment (+n_indent) is because the indent is still in the buffer when content runs first — content starts at col 1+n_indent, not col 1.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help, \-h
Show help and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable debug logging to /tmp/ad_debug/.
.SH INPUT/OUTPUT
V2 TSV format. Input should be post-reorder (see
.BR ad_layer_reorder (1)).
.SH CONFIGURATION
No environment variables. This layer has no user-configurable options.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B ad_layer_indent_last < reordered_ops.txt > indent_last_ops.txt
Move whitespace deletes to end of line.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ad_postprocess (1),
.BR ad_layer_reorder (1)
.PP
.I docs/src/plugin-layers.md
